GCUAAUAAUGCUAAGACAAAC&UGACCCACCUCCUGGAAUGACCUUAAAUGAGAAGAGUGUUCAAAAUUCAAUUACACAGUGGAUUGUAGACAUGGAAGGUGCACCAGGUACCUUAUAUGAAGGGGAAAAAUUUCAACUUCUAUUUAAAUUUAGUAGUCGAUAUCCUUUUGACUCUCCUCAGGUCAUGUUUACUGGUGAAAAUAUUCCUGUUCAUCCUCAUGUUUAUAGCAAUGGUCAUAUCUGUUUAUCCAUUC\
